## Lint errors

When tests have been written, check that there are no eslint or typescript errors. If there are, fix them all.

## Final checks

1. After writing tests, check that:

    - all the tests are passing: `cd app && yarn test`.
    - there are no eslint errors: `cd app && yarn lint`.
    - there are no typescript errors: `cd app && yarn type-check`.
  
2. Check that the coverage of the new/changed test's code is at least 80%.